      "comment" : "Stats tab, Body & Mood card: ends the line under a finding ('… — across 42 days.'). The placeholder is how many days the finding rests on. It arrives as digits in a string placeholder, exactly as the English has always printed it (never grouped), so the catalog cannot vary it by count: phrase it so one form reads right for every count."
    },
    "Across a week, your emotions are…" : {
