      "comment" : "Share card image (Year One), drawn on a 1080px square and posted publicly. Value for 'Brightest star': the person the user mentioned most, then on how many nights. First placeholder: a name from the journal. Second: the count. About 22 characters. The number arrives as digits in a string placeholder, exactly as the English has always printed it (never grouped), so the catalog cannot vary it by count: phrase it so one form reads right for every count.",
