      "comment" : "Twin maturity level, 50-99 entries. Shown beside the data-points count on the Twin tab and on the personality card. One word, about 12 characters.\nTwin tab: how deep the sky is, 100-199 entries. Shown upper case after the star count. One word, about 12 characters."
