    "No on-device speech model is installed yet, so this one is saved as audio. Turn on Settings > General > Keyboard > Dictation and iOS will fetch the model once; every entry after that transcribes here. Tap Edit to write this one yourself. DailyVox will not transcribe over a network." : {
      "comment" : "Alert message on the Speak tab, under the title 'Recording Saved': the recording was kept but could not be transcribed on this iPhone. 'Settings > General > Keyboard > Dictation' must match the iOS Settings path in the target language exactly. 'Edit' is the button on the entry. Must keep the promise that DailyVox never transcribes over a network."
    },
    "No sign-up, no tracking, no analytics" : {
      "comment" : "Settings > Privacy & Security: line under 'No Account Required'. About 60 characters."
    },
    "no streak yet" : {
      "comment" : "Today header, top right, for a journal with no entries."
    },
    "noon" : {
      "comment" : "Personality card (Twin tab and the shared image): peak writing time at hour 12, the value above 'Peak Time'. About 8 characters.\nStats > Your Week, Decoded: the hour 12:00, used in 'Happiest entries at <hour>.' Lower case."
    },
    "not included" : {
      "comment" : "Share card image (Body), drawn on a 1080px square and posted publicly. Row value when health data is off: no sleep data is on the card. Lower case, about 14 characters."
