        }
      }
    },
    "You said \"want\" %lld times this week.\n\"Should\"? Only %lld." : {
      "comment" : "Stats > Your Week, Decoded: insight card headline (large type, also drawn into a shared image). The card appears only for weeks the app could read, which today means English entries. Two lines. 'want' and 'should' are the English words the user actually said (counted in English text), so keep them in English inside the quotation marks. First placeholder: count of desire words (want, wish, hope…), 5 or more. Second: count of obligation words (should, must, have to…). About 60 characters.",
