    "When DailyVox notices context from your day — the kind of photos you took, the music you reached for — it waits here for you to keep or let go." : {
      "comment" : "Ambient signals review sheet: empty state, under 'Nothing waiting'. 'keep' and 'let go' match the Keep and Let go buttons. About 140 characters.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn DailyVox Kontext aus deinem Tag bemerkt – die Art Fotos, die du gemacht hast, die Musik, zu der du gegriffen hast – wartet er hier darauf, dass du behältst oder loslässt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando DailyVox nota contexto de tu día —el tipo de fotos que hiciste, la música que buscaste— espera aquí a que lo conserves o lo sueltes."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quand DailyVox remarque du contexte issu de ta journée — le genre de photos prises, la musique choisie — il attend ici que tu gardes ou laisses aller."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quando DailyVox nota il contesto della tua giornata — il tipo di foto scattate, la musica scelta — resta qui in attesa che tu tenga o lasci andare."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When You Write" : {
      "comment" : "Twin tab > Patterns: card header. About 24 characters."
    },
    "When your body has something to add after an entry, it will rest here until you decide." : {
      "comment" : "Body Twin review sheet: empty state, under 'Nothing waiting'. About 90 characters.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn dein Körper nach einem Eintrag etwas hinzuzufügen hat, ruht es hier, bis du entscheidest."
